  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Logistical Support to the Norwegian Election Observer Group to the EU Election Observation Mission (EU EOM) for the General Elections in Zimbabwe 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The European Commission/FPl 3 appointed IOM with the logistical and administrative implementation of the EU EOM Zimbabwe 2023. In accordance with the terms of reference of the EU EOM Zimbabwe 2023, IOM will provide logistical and administrative support to two Norwegian Election Observers (one LTO and one STO), who are members of the EU EOM observer group; for this purpose, a separate agreement is signed between IOM and the Norwegian Foundation - Norwegian Refugee Council (NRC).</narrative>
  </description>
